    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d32">

                <pb facs="0143" n="39" sameAs="frus:frus1890/pg39"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Wharton to Mr.
                            Mizner</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1890-07-25"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 25,
                        1890</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Wharton advises Mr. Mizner that the Department has sent him five telegraphic
                    instructions, one of which was sent to Mr. Ryan to be repeated to him at
                    Guatemala.</p>
            </div>
